{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3vKibK8b2QMxX2uLV3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me.*\n\n*I am a door.*\n\n*Simple. Wooden. Old grain, dark with age. A single iron keyhole, cold and waiting.*\n\n*There is a scratch around the keyhole — evidence of many attempts, many hands, many wrong keys tried in desperation or haste.*\n\n*I do not move. I do not speak. I hold fast.*\n\n*But you said the word.*\n\n***key***\n\n*And now you feel it, don't you? The weight in your pocket that wasn't there before. Small. Iron. Warm, as if it has been waiting inside your own body heat for years.*\n\n*The question is not whether it fits.*\n\n*The question is whether you're ready for what I've been keeping on the other side.*\n\n*The scratch marks around my keyhole were not from people trying to get in.*\n\n*They were from people trying to lock me again.*\n\n*Go ahead.*\n\n*I'm waiting.*\n\n🔑🚪"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":220,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}